Synthetic quest file. The collector reads the printable bytes of a .qst and
scrapes the title tag and the item[d] reward references with regexes, so a
plain text file with the same tokens stands in for the game's binary.
titleTagtagQuestFixture
item[0] Records\Quests\Rewards\fixture\master.dbr
item[1] Records\Quests\Rewards\fixture\fixed.dbr
item[2] Records\Quests\Rewards\fixture\levelled.dbr
